* slot7_stage_b: stage B of the slot-7 test platform (2026-11-06, docs/slot7_testplatform/PLAN.md section 9).
* Stage A (slot7_testplatform.spice) is unchanged; the new top slot7_testplatform_ab instantiates stage A's cells
* directly (it needs the cores' output nets i_oa / i_bg, which slot7_testplatform does not export) plus stage B.
*
* Needs, besides what slot7_testplatform.spice needs:
*   ../../../bias_tree_noab_pd/netlist/source/bias_tree_noab_pd.spice   (bias_tree_noab_pd; uses bias_diodes)
*
* Stage B:
*   - bias_tree_noab_pd (the tree of the S2D pad); its reference current selectable by transmission gates from the OA
*     core (dig_in[4]), the BG core (dig_in[5]) or the harness ibias0 (dig_in[6]); tree enable dig_in[7];
*   - its bias voltages vbp / vbn / vbpc / vbnc onto analog_bus2 through transmission gates (dig_in[8..11]);
*   - the harness ibias1 onto analog_bus3 (dig_in[12]), to measure the harness bias through the same path;
*   - every enable fail-safe as in stage A: dig_in[k] AND enable AND (slot vdd_1v2 present), no read-back.

* tp_en_ctrl_b: nine channels of tp_en_ctrl (no read-back, no tie-lows, no NRD: stage A's NRD pulls the slot's
* vdd_1v2 low when it is gated off, and the read-back pins are all used by stage A).
.subckt tp_en_ctrl_b vdd_3v3 vss_3v3 vdd_1v2 en0_1v2 en1_1v2 en2_1v2 en3_1v2 en4_1v2 en5_1v2 en6_1v2 en7_1v2
+ en8_1v2 enable en0 en0_b en1 en1_b en2 en2_b en3 en3_b en4 en4_b en5 en5_b en6 en6_b en7 en7_b en8 en8_b
XPU0 xb0 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU1 xb1 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU2 xb2 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU3 xb3 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU4 xb4 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU5 xb5 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU6 xb6 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU7 xb7 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XPU8 xb8 vss_3v3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=0.3u l=20u ng=1
XNI0 xb0 en0_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI1 xb1 en1_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI2 xb2 en2_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI3 xb3 en3_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI4 xb4 en4_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI5 xb5 en5_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI6 xb6 en6_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI7 xb7 en7_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNI8 xb8 en8_1v2 ns1 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNE ns1 enable ns2 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XNV ns2 vdd_1v2 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=2u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA0 en0 xb0 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA0 en0 xb0 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB0 en0_b en0 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB0 en0_b en0 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA1 en1 xb1 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA1 en1 xb1 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB1 en1_b en1 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB1 en1_b en1 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA2 en2 xb2 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA2 en2 xb2 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB2 en2_b en2 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB2 en2_b en2 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA3 en3 xb3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA3 en3 xb3 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB3 en3_b en3 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB3 en3_b en3 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA4 en4 xb4 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA4 en4 xb4 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB4 en4_b en4 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB4 en4_b en4 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA5 en5 xb5 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA5 en5 xb5 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB5 en5_b en5 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB5 en5_b en5 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA6 en6 xb6 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA6 en6 xb6 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPB6 en6_b en6 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNB6 en6_b en6 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XPA7 en7 xb7 vdd_3v3 vdd_3v3 sg13_hv_pmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
XNA7 en7 xb7 vss_3v3 vss_3v3 sg13_hv_nmos w=1u l=0.45u ng=1
